OL,3,GNEWSALearner sentenced for driving test
OL,4,Aearpiece fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA learner driver has been sentenced for
OL,7,Ffraud after repeatedly using a hidden
OL,8,Felectronic earpiece to cheat in his
OL,9,Fdriving theory test.
OL,11,FThe Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency
OL,12,F(DVSA) said Hemin Braim Abdullah was
OL,13,Fspotted on CCTV at Bournemouth Test
OL,14,FCentre in 2024 inserting the device
OL,15,Finto his headphones prior to taking the
OL,16,Ftest, which he passed.
OL,18,FHe was given 12-week prison sentence,
OL,19,Fsuspended for 12 months, and ordered to
OL,20,Fpay #687 after admitting three counts
OL,21,Fof fraud.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
